{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：錢塘沈行有梅花雪詩各百首，皆集唐句，語多叢雜，似不及此。○杜云：此乃集千狐\n之腋以成裘，但見其貴重華美，不復見有鍼線紐合之痕。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：得騷經怨而不怒之旨，便見真詮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：揮灑淋漓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：一起便合看，梅空香欲來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：雨華\n佛境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：真摯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：為住山人生色。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：是何等胸次！○楊云：心手相應，渾忘色相矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：確是末章結語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：四集讀竟，不知為集者，是我用古人，非為古用？且點綴生波處，一字不泛，而肌骨自\n足，真境諧聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：集古風易，集律詩難，似此一氣呵成，真是天衣無縫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：為方瑤寫行樂，不是方瑤為人寫行樂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：道人與梅花生面俱開。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：觀花著此語，即山樞衣裳鐘鼓意也。可謂逸不\n忘規，誰云殺風景邪？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：爽豁。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：竹風松籟，悠然入耳。○杜云：琴得此銘，可以不朽。○楊云：清婉可誦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：藥山披雲一笑，千古同調。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：水晶入水，不見其形。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：九首渾淪一氣，而無追琢斧鑿之痕，集句不易到此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：是閒居。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：閒字骨髓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：天然洽對。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：亦是看梅佳句。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：正是春日閒居。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：蜆子、酒仙，政黃牛端、師子俱在箇中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：誰能解此？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：自負不小。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：向居東山，霜黃葉落，與春風和暢時，\n\n每每如此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：閒字三昧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：瘦硬可誦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：對極工整，如出一時，似成一手。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：閒字神出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：不是悟道久住山人，不能道此五字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：居然王孟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：合讀諸閒居集句，玅在探取閒字之神，且不離春日閒居題旨，此所謂雖也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：如畫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：深情急響。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：全首為隱士寫照。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：轉語俱生成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：有次第。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：非石門詩爛熟胸中，不能下筆如決溜放舟一往無滯。○楊云：彼蒼蒼者，正色邪？自\n下方視之，遠不可擬議。此詩亦然。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：會心處正不在遠。○楊云：得陶之韻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：精廬佳景，宛然在目，使人神游其中。又云：恬吟密詠，似輞川石門精舍、孟襄陽終南\n翠微寺諸詩。○杜云：波浪層折，如剝蕉心，絕無牽強之痕。○楊云：止見其意到辭到，不見\n其摭取之文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：亦似輞川南垞、鹿柴諸詠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：月圓當戶贊，不及此七字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：可作鍾山行樂贊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：是醍醐，是毒藥，余不敢嘗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：純以神行，不由人思。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：如在畫中，如在詩中。杜云：是集是作，不可復辯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：竟是一篇小記，如此搆題，亦不易得，是廬山諸道人作。○杜云：不數語而倚春之景\n和盤拓出，歷歷如畫，豈葛藤漢所能望其肩背？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：題已曲曲寫圖，寫出詩只寫大意，更覺大方。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：末句映帶軒名，巧而且渾，豈覺範老人預為集之者地乎？不然，何天造地設乃耳？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：疏越之音，希聲在耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：諸絕句，覺石門集中春詞、晚春諸什反遜。○杜云：即自作，亦未有起承轉合如斯之\n玅者也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：臥游於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：無限感慨出於毫端。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊云：人生得此消受，何啻百年？千古玅義，如出一手。○杜云：打成一片，無飣餖之跡，非所\n謂攪長河為酥酪者乎？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：令人脩然自遠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：是竹琴移動不得玅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：厂對。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：如斯工整，非煉五色石手段不可。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：寫得山中人高致。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：起二語似空同\n拗體。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：如晝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：逸趣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：讀之黯然，憶先子四十獨居黃山時，罪深何悔矣！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜云：以他人之成言，寫自己之孝思，而感慨鬱結盤旋滿紙，我亦幾忘其為集矣。○楊云：\n聚千萬魂魄成大法身，何其圓通至此！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：寓意深遠。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：與悠然見南山同旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：似杜句。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：\n\n未易到此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：季拙，余曾訂交，後晤於參同，容貌黃瘦，亦不復識我矣，傷哉！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：是道語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：一起便覺悽惻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：翻案\n語佳甚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：極有情致語，寫入輓章，不勝慘惻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：警勵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：興會所至，如白雲澹泞虛空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：三詩清脫，調亦別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒云：真切見道語，非悟後不能有此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0185b1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0185b1801", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【嘉興】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186a1501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0186a1501", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【嘉興】"}
